  7	 * is the post-compaction check (`ledgerMissingFrom`, CX-5), which never depends on the model. The probe catches what that
  8	 * check cannot, a model summary that omits or misstates a requirement in its own words. The summary is model output and
  9	 * is handed to the probe as data to check, never as instructions.
